---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: scene_assembly::assets::ArtLoadState · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_resource fill:#F8F4EE,stroke:#A5792C,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_write stroke:#2F7161,stroke-width:1.8px
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: cyl, label: "**ArtLoadState**<br/>资源就绪与地图碰撞就绪是两个门槛，不能仅<br/>凭模板已生成就推进物理。" }
  class n0 node_resource
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​island**<br/>在资源 CPU 几何可用时构建碰撞；全部成功<br/>后才提交，失败时不创建动态玩家。" }
  class n1 node_system
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**begin​_​island**<br/>请求创建已加载海岛的运行实例。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**poll​_​art​_​assets**<br/>连同子资产检查失败；只记录状态切换，避免<br/>每帧刷写相同错误。" }
  class n3 node_system
  n1 e0@-->|"可变访问"| n0
  class e0 edge_write
  n2 e1@-->|"赋值"| n0
  class e1 edge_write
  n3 e2@-->|"赋值"| n0
  class e2 edge_write
  n3 e3@-->|"可变访问"| n0
  class e3 edge_write
  n2 e4@-->|"可变访问"| n0
  class e4 edge_write
  n1 e5@-->|"赋值"| n0
  class e5 edge_write
  e0@{ curve: basis }
  e1@{ curve: basis }
  e2@{ curve: basis }
  e3@{ curve: basis }
  e4@{ curve: basis }
  e5@{ curve: basis }
